{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55144","headline":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 三十四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 三十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三刑内，最恶是天罡。\n或是季兮爲日上，冲加四煞必相伤，夜即恐惊忙（京本作「亡」。\n魁罡临日，主大将死，临辰，主小将死，日辰俱临，俱死。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55144.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55144","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}